Package: InferPheno
Title: Phenotype Inference from Replicable Axes of Variation
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Sehyun", "Oh", , "shbrief@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-9490-3061")))
Description: Infer clinical and molecular phenotypes from gene expression
    data using a fixed, unsupervised Replicable Axes of Variation (RAV)
    basis from GenomicSuperSignature. Ships pre-fit supervised heads for
    sex, microsatellite instability status, MSI score, consensus
    molecular subtype, and additional phenotypes scored in the
    accompanying atlas. Designed as a drop-in alternative to
    task-specific classifiers when interpretability and cross-platform
    transfer matter more than peak accuracy on the source platform.
